	Shared/Assets/FallbackKeys — image keys that render without an uploaded asset (data only).

	Purpose:          Declares which icon keys have a built-in fallback so AssetResolver can tell "renders as a
	                  glyph" from "missing": `glyphs` have a dedicated primitive glyph in Client/UI/Icons (class
	                  symbols, tiers, currencies, ammo, modules x states, crew, battle hit results / pings / commands /
	                  HUD alerts / minimap markers, core UI glyphs); keys in `badgeCategories` render the generic
	                  category badge until uploaded; `awaitingArt` lists glyph keys whose source SVG is still to come.
	Dependencies:     None.
	State:            Constant table (frozen).
	Validation:       tests/Unit/ReplicatedStorage/Client/UI/Icons asserts this list equals the Icons registry and that
	                  every key with a source SVG folder matches a file in assets/icons.
	Error handling:   N/A.
	Performance notes: Indexed once into a set by AssetResolver.
]]

